3. **Informational Non-Legal Status:**
   NIYAMLENS is an AI-assisted regulatory decision-support prototype. It does not
   constitute an official building permit, certified legal opinion, or binding
   administrative approval under the M.P. Nagar Tatha Gram Nivesh Adhiniyam, 1973,
   or the M.P. Bhumi Vikas Rules, 2012.
